/NM (4aa3f251\0551e4a\0554411\05583ff\05519fe795047ec)
/Rect [ 66.812 52.174684 566.598 565.894 ]
/T (Text Field50)
/V (Environmental Monitoring \050EM\051 Recoveries Review\072\015 \015ISO 5 BSC and Personnel Evaluation\072\015Upon review of the environmental monitoring data\054 absence of microbial recovery \050No Growth\051 was demonstrated across all critical ISO 5 zones and personnel monitoring on the date of testing\056 Daily personnel monitoring for processing analyst Halaina Smith and changeover analyst America Alanis yielded no microbial growth on left and right fingertip touch plates\056 Daily surface sampling \0504 locations\051 and settling plates within processing BSC E001938 and changeover BSC E001937 yielded no microbial growth\056\015 \015Cleanroom EM Evaluation\072\015Weekly surface monitoring of Cleanroom Parallel Suite conducted on 20Oct26 demonstrated no microbial recovery across all sampled cleanroom surfaces\054 confirming effective sanitization and surface control\056\015 \015Weekly active air monitoring of Cleanroom Suite conducted on 20Oct26 demonstrated no microbial recovery in ISO 7 cleanroom 145\073 however\054 2 CFUs under test sample ETX\055261027\0550484 were recovered from ISO 7 cleanroom 144 Section I\054 21 CFUs under test sample ETX\055261027\0550487 were recovered from ISO 8 room 143 Section I\054 17 CFUs under test sample ETX\055261027\0550492 were recovered from ISO 8 room 143 Section II\054 and 16 CFUs under test sample ETX\055261027\0550494 were recovered from outermost ISO 8 room 142\056 Microbial identification testing for all recovered environmental isolates remains pending as of 09Nov2026 and continues to be monitored under extended review\056\015 \015It is important to emphasize that all sample processing activities were performed strictly within the validated ISO 5 BSC E001938 and changeover activities within ISO 5 BSC E001937 \050both located in ISO 7 cleanroom 144\051\056 There is minimal exposure of the test sample to ambient ISO 8 air\054 as samples and supplies are transferred in disinfected\054 closed containers on carts through the layered cleanroom suites\056 Furthermore\054 the active air recoveries occurred in the general cleanroom and lower\055classified outer room environments\054 which are physically segregated from the ISO 5 processing zone by closed doors and an outward\055cascading positive air pressure gradient\056 In conjunction with the complete absence of microbial growth on all analyst glove touch plates\054 settling plates\054 and ISO 5 BSC work surfaces throughout testing\054 there is no plausible contamination transfer pathway from the ambient environment to the test sample\056\015 \015Monthly cleaning and disinfection of the cleanrooms \050ISO 7\051 and their containing biosafety cabinets \050ISO 5\051 were performed on 27Sep26 for the suite\054 as per MICRO\055SOP\0559\054 Cleaning and Disinfecting Procedure for Microbiology\056 It was documented that all chemical indicators passed\054 which confirmed the efficient monthly cleaning of all cleanrooms\056\015 \015Analyzing a 6\055month sample history for Optio RX \050E18631\051\054 this specific analyte \042Niacinamide\057Tirzepatide 2mg\05717\05665mg\057mL \0504mL\051 Inj\056\042 has had no prior Out\055of\055Specification \050OOS\051 occurrences under ScanRDI sterility testing\056\015 \015All samples processed within the same batch were also evaluated for evidence of sample\055to\055sample cross\055contamination\056 The test sample ETX\055261017\0550071 was processed as the 12th sample \050hs12\051 by Halaina Smith on 20Oct26 within BSC E001938 \050Cleanroom 144\054 Parallel Suite\051\056 One other sample within the same testing batch \050ETX\055261019\0550668\054 hs53\054 documented under OOS\055262395 for CasaPharma Rx\051 yielded a positive result for cocci\055shaped morphology but was processed as the 53rd sample\056 The two testing events were separated in sequence by 41 intermediate negative samples and exhibited different cellular morphologies \050rod\055shaped morphology in ETX\055261017\0550071 versus cocci\055shaped morphology in ETX\055261019\0550668 under OOS\055262395\051\056 A third positive sample tested on the same date \050ETX\055261017\0550024\054 documented under OOS\055262396 for Link Pharmacy\051 was processed by a different analyst \050Perris Gary\054 36th sample\051 in a separate biological safety cabinet \050BSC E001317\054 Room 145\051 with changeover by America Alanis \050BSC E001937\054 Room 144\051\056 Furthermore\054 analyst Halaina Smith verified that gloves were sanitized between samples and standard aseptic techniques were strictly maintained\056 Consequently\054 there is no evidence of sample\055to\055sample cross\055contamination or a shared laboratory vector\056\015 \015Based on the laboratory investigation\054 no assignable laboratory cause was identified involving the analyst\054 instrument\054 reagents\054 supplies\054 or monitored laboratory environment\056 Therefore\054 the likelihood of laboratory error contributing to this failure is considered minimal\054 and the original result is deemed valid\056)
>>
endobj
